<title>UK: One Brent cargo clocked, the other kept - traders.</title>
<headline>One Brent cargo clocked, the other kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the Brent cargoes nominated from the paper chains on Thursday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, while the other was left unclaimed, traders said.</p>
<p>Esso kept a cargo loading July 18-20, while the other was heard clocked to Shell UK, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
